Package: audiotranscriber
Type: Package
Title: Reusable Long-Audio Transcription Utilities for R
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Adam", "Quek", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Utilities for splitting long audio with ffmpeg, submitting chunks
    to the OpenAI Audio Transcriptions API, resuming interrupted jobs, and
    stitching chunk transcripts into Markdown output.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends:
    R (>= 4.2)
Imports:
    fs,
    httr,
    jsonlite
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
